<title>SWITZERLAND: Holderbank names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Holderbank names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>GLARIS, Switzerland 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cement and building materials group Holderbank Financiere Glaris Ltd said it has named Theophil Schlatter to a newly created post of chief financial officer (CFO).</p>
<p>Schlatter will join the concern's executive committee with effect from the 1997 general meeting June 6, Holderbank said.</p>
<p>Schlatter, 45, is currently finance director and member of the management board of Holderbank Cement und Beton.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
